  "id": "bc_1782963155450",
  "loop": 0,
  "message_interval": 5,
  "messages": [
    {
      "text": "ACID COLA REPORTS RECORD PROFITS • POLICE ADVISE CITIZENS TO AVOID DISTRICT 12 • CITY TRANSIT EXPECTS ONLY MODERATE EXPLOSIONS TODAY • BUY NEO-NOODLES: NOW 12% LESS SYNTHETIC •"
    },
    {
      "text": "The broadcast opens on a brightly lit studio bathed in neon blues and warm amber lights. A packed audience applauds enthusiastically while the Tonight Show band finishes the opening bars of the theme."
    },
    {
      "text": "From somewhere above the smog and only slightly outside the blast radius..."
    },
    {
      "text": "It's..."
    },
    {
      "text": "The Tonight Show!"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tonight..."
    },
    {
      "text": "Corporate executives explain why exploding vending machines are actually a premium feature."
    },
    {
      "text": "A local street chef prepares authentic mutant squid tacos."
    },
    {
      "text": "And we'll meet a man who's legally declared his apartment to be an independent nation."
    },
    {
      "text": "Ladies and gentlemen..."
    },
    {
      "text": "JOOOOOHN AKERSON!"
    },
    {
      "text": "The camera follows John Akerson as he jogs onto the stage, shaking hands with audience members before stopping behind his desk with a broad smile."
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sit down! We've got a fantastic show tonight!"
    },
    {
      "text": "Did everyone survive the commute?"
    },
    {
      "text": "Traffic was backed up six blocks after somebody hacked the crossing lights to advertise noodles."
    },
    {
      "text": "Corporate Security says crime is down."
    },
    {
      "text": "Apparently they stopped counting anything outside corporate property."
    },
    {
      "text": "I stopped by a pharmacy today."
    },
    {
      "text": "They've started locking up bottled water."
    },
    {
      "text": "The cybernetic organs are still self-service though."
    },
    {
      "text": "You know times are tough when the mugger accepts store credit."
    },
    {
      "text": "Good news though..."
    },
    {
      "text": "My landlord says the building is structurally sound."
    },
    {
      "text": "Apparently that's a completely different thing than \"safe.\""
    },
    {
      "text": "The camera settles into a comfortable two-shot as John and tonight's guest sit beneath the warm studio lights."
    },
    {
      "text": "Lenny, welcome to the show."
    },
    {
      "text": "Happy to be here."
    },
    {
      "text": "You won the city lottery seven times."
    },
    {
      "text": "Eight."
    },
    {
      "text": "Eight?"
    },
    {
      "text": "The eighth time they stopped congratulating me and started interviewing me."
    },
    {
      "text": "What's your secret?"
    },
    {
      "text": "Always buy your ticket after surviving something that should've killed you."
    },
    {
      "text": "That's oddly specific."
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm from Eastside."
    },
    {
      "text": "What's the first thing you bought?"
    },
    {
      "text": "A deluxe apartment."
    },
    {
      "text": "Nice!"
    },
    {
      "text": "The deluxe part is that only one wall leaks."
    },
    {
      "text": "The broadcast abruptly transitions to an aggressively colorful commercial surrounded by flashing corporate branding."
    },
    {
      "text": "Feeling tired?"
    },
    {
      "text": "Feeling hopeless?"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drink Acid Cola™."
    },
    {
      "text": "Because reality is easier to tolerate when it's carbonated."
    },
    {
      "text": "That's all the time we've got tonight."
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks to Lenny for joining us."
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember..."
    },
    {
      "text": "If somebody offers you free cyberware in an alley.."
    },
    {
      "text": "...at least ask if it comes with a warranty."
    },
    {
      "text": "Good night, everybody!"
    },
    {
      "text": "The camera slowly pulls back as John waves to the audience. The Tonight Show band reprises the theme while the audience rises for a standing ovation beneath glowing neon studio lights."
    }
  ],
